  divisionTitle: Axial Skeleton
  divisionDescription: "Forms the body\u2019s central axis and includes the skull,
    vertebral column, and thoracic cage. It primarily provides structural support
    and protects vital organs such as the brain, spinal cord, heart, and lungs."
